{"3908670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "3025", "steam_appid": 3908670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERVIEW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a 22-year-old who has just entered the working class of Alterra in the year 3025. Earth has thrived for decades, offering endless opportunities for young hustlers. But now that it's your turn to earn Omnis, the government reveals a dark truth. Earth's resources will be gone by 3030, and only a limited number of one-way tickets off the planet remain. Each ticket costs 1,000,000 Omnis, and you have just five years to make it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you climb the corporate ladder and serve the machine, or carve your own path and build wealth through any means necessary?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Is life in 3025 just about working, or is there something more waiting to be discovered?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find your purpose. Burn bright. Your destiny awaits among the stars.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/8ad01ab2592cfd9fd64f490b9e8dfb27.webp?t=1784477199\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/eb1c426520e10568745e581a75a5541d.avif?t=1784477199\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/7fe08820b16cf3ec33fca5cb3e354098.poster.avif?t=1784477199\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/7fe08820b16cf3ec33fca5cb3e354098.webm?t=1784477199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/7fe08820b16cf3ec33fca5cb3e354098.mp4?t=1784477199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast, interactive world filled with jobs, side hustles, and escapes from reality. Each location serves a purpose-but is it rooted in something deeper?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/8ad01ab2592cfd9fd64f490b9e8dfb27.webp?t=1784477199\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/58c215ed559cac23febe2f4e3f31b372.avif?t=1784477199\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/12ac7a548dbc89c0388862b84a639d37.poster.avif?t=1784477199\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/12ac7a548dbc89c0388862b84a639d37.webm?t=1784477199\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/12ac7a548dbc89c0388862b84a639d37.mp4?t=1784477199\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey begins at the Energy Management Network (EMN), the heart of Alterra’s power supply. As a Digital Miner, your purpose is simple: generate energy, earn Omnis, and never forget who you serve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3908670/extras/8ad01ab2592cfd9fd64f490b9e8dfb27.webp